---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy – VISUA1HUE" description="What this site does and doesn't do with your data.">
  <main>
    <article class="policy">
      <a class="back text-label" href="/">← VISUA1HUE</a>
      <h1 class="label text-label">Privacy Policy</h1>
      {/* TODO before launch: add controller name and contact details (GDPR Art. 13) and have this reviewed */}

      <p class="text-lead">
        <strong>No cookies, no analytics, no tracking.</strong> This site doesn't load anything from third parties: fonts
        and scripts are served from this domain.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-label">Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site runs on Cloudflare. To deliver and protect it, Cloudflare processes technical data for every request:
        IP address, browser, requested page and time. This is kept in short-lived logs and isn't used to identify or
        profile you. Legal basis: legitimate interest in running a secure website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
        See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-label">Stored on your device</h2>
      <p>
        If you switch <strong>DEBUG</strong> on, your choice is saved in your browser's local storage
        under <code>visua1hue-debug</code>. The performance numbers it shows are measured in your browser and never sent
        anywhere. Clearing site data removes it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-label">External links</h2>
      <p>Links to LinkedIn and GitHub take you to their sites, where their privacy policies apply.</p>

      <h2 class="text-label">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict processing of your data, to object to processing, and
        to complain to a data protection authority.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .policy {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 120px 24px clamp(96px, 12vw, 144px);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: var(--hit-target);
  }

  .back:hover {
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }

  .label {
    margin: 32px 0 28px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }

  p a {
    color: var(--color-fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--color-soft);
  }
</style>
